#: src/components/core/InstallButton.tsx:99
msgid "Not possible with the current setup. Click to know more."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ດ້ວຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນ. ຄລິກເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#: src/components/core/InstallationExit.tsx:43
msgid "Your system is rebooting"
msgstr "ລະບົບຂອງທ່ານກຳລັງເລີ່ມໃໝ່"

#: src/components/core/InstallationExit.tsx:47
msgid ""
"The installer interface is no longer available, so you can safely close this "
"window."
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຕິດຕັ້ງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດປິດໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພ."

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:52
msgid "TPM sealing requires the new system to be booted directly."
msgstr "ການປິດຜະນຶກ TPM ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ລະບົບໃໝ່ຖືກບູດໂດຍກົງ."

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:57
msgid ""
"If a local media was used to run this installer, remove it before the next "
"boot."
msgstr "ຖ້າມີການໃຊ້ສື່ຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃນ, ໃຫ້ຖອດມັນອອກກ່ອນການບູດເຄື່ອງຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:61
msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອງລາຍລະອຽດ"

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:61
msgid "See more details"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:66
msgid ""
"The final step to configure the Trusted Platform Module (TPM) to "
"automatically open encrypted devices will take place during the first boot "
"of the new system. For that to work, the machine needs to boot directly to "
"the new boot loader."
msgstr ""
"ຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Trusted Platform Module (TPM) "
"ເພື່ອເປີດອຸປະກອນທີ່ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນໃນລະຫວ່າງການບູດເຄື່ອງຄັ້ງທຳອິດຂອງລະບົບໃໝ່. "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້, ເຄື່ອງຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງບູດໂດຍກົງໄປຫາຕົວໂຫຼດບູດໃໝ່."

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:124
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "ຂໍສະແດງຄວາມຍິນດີ!"

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:130
msgid "The installation on your machine is complete."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນເຄື່ອງຂອງທ່ານສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:134
msgid "At this point you can power off the machine."
msgstr "ໃນຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດປິດເຄື່ອງໄດ້."

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:135
msgid "At this point you can reboot the machine to log in to the new system."
msgstr "ໃນຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມເຄື່ອງໃໝ່ເພື່ອເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່."

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:142
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "ສຳເລັດ"

#: src/components/core/InstallationFinished.tsx:142
msgid "Reboot"
msgstr "ເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່"

